    {"id":"C026","lawId":"L008","article":"6.1.1","quote":"一个计算单元内配置的灭火器数量不得少于2具。","checked":"2026-09-08","status":"已核验","sourceUrl":"https://ghzrzyw.beijing.gov.cn/zhengwuxinxi/zcwj/qtwj/202409/P020240914543945101730.pdf"},
    {"id":"C027","lawId":"L007","article":"10.0.5","quote":"灭火器不应设置在可能超出其使用温度范围的场所，并应采取与设置场所环境条件相适应的防护措施。","checked":"2026-09-08","status":"已核验","sourceUrl":"https://www.yantian.gov.cn/ytjsj/attachment/1/1561/1561739/12083207.pdf"},
    {"id":"C028","lawId":"L009","article":"6.1.1","quote":"配电线路应装设短路保护和过负荷保护。","checked":"2026-09-08","status":"已核验","sourceUrl":"https://files.anshan.gov.cn/files/ueditor/ASJKQ/jsp/upload/file/20211201/1638343166465002256.pdf"},
